  "title": "Filipino Sweet-rice-flour-chapssalgaru Wrap",
  "description": "A glassy-jelly brunch dish featuring sweet-rice-flour-chapssalgaru, perfect for a raw-friendly meal wrapped in pandan leaves",
  "cuisine": "Filipino",
