  "instructions": [
    "Whisk the coconut milk, maple syrup, vanilla extract, and lime juice in a bowl until well combined.",
    "Add the glazed sweet rice flour chapssalgaru to the bowl and mix until well coated.",
    "Heat a non-stick pan over medium heat and add the pandan leaf wrap.",
    "Cook for 1-2 minutes until the wrap is slightly softened.",
    "Transfer the sweet rice flour mixture to the pandan leaf wrap and fold the wrap to enclose the mixture.",
    "Cook for an additional 2-3 minutes until the wrap is crispy and the mixture is heated through.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy."
